AUDIO: 'it\'s now a permanent [music] part of the house. You sell the house, it stays. Move and you either pay thousands to rip it out or you just leave it behind. [music] That\'s not a consumer electronics product, that\'s a kitchen renovation or a lithium phosphate anchor.'

[02:43] [scene:talk]
