VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'helped on the edges, but none of them solve all four problems. What I\'m about to show you does. Now, before I get into what\'s new in home batteries, a quick word about another kind of unexpected risk worth planning for. This video is brought to you by Surfshark VPN. I spent'

